{"3846900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sword Sage: Awakening", "steam_appid": 3846900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ The Cliff Carved Scriptures, A Thousand Year Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gibbon Sage, warden of White Cloud Grotto, was charged with safeguarding the Celestial Books. In a drunken frenzy, he annotated these Celestial Books and carved them into a cliff, loosing a thousand‑year yaoguai calamity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undaunted, the folk of Guannandao forged ingenious contraptions and fought yaoguais through generations. Pei Sanniang, young disciple of the Yuangong Sect, comes home from her wanderings to find ominous beings laying waste to Guannandao. Her homeland hangs on the edge of ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/82fe9e5232fefca64bd2eb49bc41a4b5.avif?t=1787769252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras_big/82fe9e5232fefca64bd2eb49bc41a4b5.webp?t=1787769252 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ Evade Cyan, Strike Red</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyan stands for an enemy’s weapon or incoming strikes, while Red denotes their body. Disciples of the Yuangong Sect master swordplay and counter enemies using Evade Cyan, Strike Red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When blocking with your weapon, observe incoming strikes from the enemy’s upper, middle or lower directions. Evade Cyan with correct direction and timing, then execute Strike Red with a counter‑attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/bc0e9d9f6afe3b155591ab9c2adf72a7.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/bc0e9d9f6afe3b155591ab9c2adf72a7.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/bc0e9d9f6afe3b155591ab9c2adf72a7.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ Mastery Diverse Swordplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are prone to fracture when fighting yaoguai. Disciples of the Yuangong Sect carry sword cases on their backs, capable of rapidly forging two weapons within them. They may also learn diverse skills through weapon mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>For instance, Unsheathed Chop lets you deliver a swift strike against enemies while forging a weapon. The more potent Unsheathed Fire Chop demands well‑timed, rapid forging to cast fire damage upon enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/f0b2b413ddedba1bbd5fb62ea8b603ca.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/f0b2b413ddedba1bbd5fb62ea8b603ca.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/f0b2b413ddedba1bbd5fb62ea8b603ca.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ Spirit Shaping Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disciples of the Yuangong Sect master the Spirit Shaping Craft, gathering spirit to forge divine weapons. Weapons fall into three types: Three Chi Sword, Horse‑Cleaving Sword, and Twin Swords. Each weapon type boasts a host of martial‑arts techniques to learn, and every individual weapon bears its own unique weapon skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/10b712bb709e24fadc263132566ea15d.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/10b712bb709e24fadc263132566ea15d.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/10b712bb709e24fadc263132566ea15d.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ Lessons from Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful enemies unleash relentless attacks, including unpredictable ordinary strikes and unblockable critical skills. All enemy attacks shift between upper, middle and lower directions. Precise, repeated use of Evade Cyan, Strike Red is your best way to prevail. To stand against mighty enemies, consistent and precise execution of Evade Cyan, Strike Red is the surest way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/dbed18c299e742711847b4a7f5496592.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/dbed18c299e742711847b4a7f5496592.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/dbed18c299e742711847b4a7f5496592.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/45a61d4e53522679c75ee39a7ad0a8c9.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/45a61d4e53522679c75ee39a7ad0a8c9.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/45a61d4e53522679c75ee39a7ad0a8c9.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content, Outfits and light/stylistic partial nudity</i>, <i>and Imagery that some players may find disturbing.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ The Cliff Carved Scriptures, A Thousand Year Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gibbon Sage, warden of White Cloud Grotto, was charged with safeguarding the Celestial Books. In a drunken frenzy, he annotated these Celestial Books and carved them into a cliff, loosing a thousand‑year yaoguai calamity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undaunted, the folk of Guannandao forged ingenious contraptions and fought yaoguais through generations. Pei Sanniang, young disciple of the Yuangong Sect, comes home from her wanderings to find ominous beings laying waste to Guannandao. Her homeland hangs on the edge of ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/82fe9e5232fefca64bd2