pid forging to cast fire damage upon enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/f0b2b413ddedba1bbd5fb62ea8b603ca.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/f0b2b413ddedba1bbd5fb62ea8b603ca.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/f0b2b413ddedba1bbd5fb62ea8b603ca.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ Spirit Shaping Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disciples of the Yuangong Sect master the Spirit Shaping Craft, gathering spirit to forge divine weapons. Weapons fall into three types: Three Chi Sword, Horse‑Cleaving Sword, and Twin Swords. Each weapon type boasts a host of martial‑arts techniques to learn, and every individual weapon bears its own unique weapon skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/10b712bb709e24fadc263132566ea15d.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/10b712bb709e24fadc263132566ea15d.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/10b712bb709e24fadc263132566ea15d.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▪ Lessons from Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful enemies unleash relentless attacks, including unpredictable ordinary strikes and unblockable critical skills. All enemy attacks shift between upper, middle and lower directions. Precise, repeated use of Evade Cyan, Strike Red is your best way to prevail. To stand against mighty enemies, consistent and precise execution of Evade Cyan, Strike Red is the surest way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/dbed18c299e742711847b4a7f5496592.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/dbed18c299e742711847b4a7f5496592.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/dbed18c299e742711847b4a7f5496592.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/45a61d4e53522679c75ee39a7ad0a8c9.poster.avif?t=1787769252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/45a61d4e53522679c75ee39a7ad0a8c9.webm?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/extras/45a61d4e53522679c75ee39a7ad0a8c9.mp4?t=1787769252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content, Outfits and light/stylistic partial nudity</i>, <i>and Imagery that some players may find disturbing.</i></p>", "short_description": "Sword Sage: Awakening is an action RPG rooted in Chinese myth and folklore. You play as Pei Sanniang, a novice disciple of the Yuangong Sect, about to confront the thousand-year inherited burden by the leaking of the forbidden celestial books, and the many ominous forces lurking in the shadows...", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/f4b9271f53dab60156f9fa5a1c2286b786380f21/header.jpg?t=1787769252", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/304f427c9dbf86b59d2043445b502beee08103eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787769252", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846900/304f427c9dbf86b59d2043445b502beee08103eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787769252", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> HDD supported, but SSD is recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBA MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBA MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes: